    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 67,
        "text": "Hi, Lisa. How is the university's new recycling program going?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a988aa463402db01ceb3c1cfc6b853e1cd54f7b21b526dbe5e0259e75b689b98",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 74,
        "sourceEnd": 253,
        "text": "It's going well, but we have some issues. The program was designed by students and staff together. Special bins were placed in every building, but the bins are often contaminated.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "448f6aca65a814a6f6a801825a12cf988d57bbce89c2efb9512048b71bb0a084",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 259,
        "sourceEnd": 290,
        "text": "Contaminated? What do you mean?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "054fd25e15e711b0d095fdf348edb33648ed938e2fcd623eb4d8dda09dd51b61",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 297,
        "sourceEnd": 494,
        "text": "People put the wrong things in them. Yesterday someone put a greasy pizza box in the paper bin. The food left on it caused a problem. That whole load had to be checked before it could be processed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "516dc72de795abaef48d1fcb9034ada27b8d8dc72d930a63661662da830eaa35",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 500,
        "sourceEnd": 528,
        "text": "What are you doing about it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7700a5c3567bb73faaebbac842cd2ca27fd274ffce6ee91ef86656463a36386c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 535,
        "sourceEnd": 607,
        "text": "We're making new signs. They will have pictures to show what goes where.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "82fe6b17f12b8ecfdb35ccf3625d49cf01a2bd947221a09c06589ec0a6d65796",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 613,
        "sourceEnd": 637,
        "text": "When will they be ready?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ae69466f6c97d641baf5bdae7e10cd5ff6cdff418f3d6cb1ecf12239ddb4513e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 644,
        "sourceEnd": 821,
        "text": "They should be ready by next Monday. Also, we're organizing training for volunteers. We'll teach volunteers how to sort waste properly because mixed-up waste creates extra work.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "55485c911fb85b9d96ae3bec73fdeffba58d0efec5e1515c5dec0912ff290aa5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 827,
        "sourceEnd": 859,
        "text": "How many volunteers do you have?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0cd391332158944a264603cf59252918d4d32c53655c5c6ee214cd3969961296",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 866,
        "sourceEnd": 1033,
        "text": "About 50 students are volunteering now. We need more, especially during exam weeks. Volunteers can choose a short shift rather than missing a whole afternoon of study.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "1c4f8f868598acbbe585294c5c137bf5ff0877e07fbdd915e4c0bfab8984b4b9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1039,
        "sourceEnd": 1075,
        "text": "I could help. I have some free time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9ee5a4206ca336b209517bd4aaee89ac131d33aa09ae1d90b0c39de5fd9499a3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 1082,
        "sourceEnd": 1206,
        "text": "Great! We meet every Tuesday at 4 pm in the student center. I'll introduce you to the team, and then you can choose a shift.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a462e1ed5162d520762adfb52a13af8c48f45b885ae49a29795fd34a1cfa9bd9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1212,
        "sourceEnd": 1247,
        "text": "Is the program making a difference?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "705ab8fe5c20774891b3da179bb6461f88c3d1f88e5e54a2d2e93c33a89a3aa1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 1254,
        "sourceEnd": 1366,
        "text": "Yes. In our simulated project records, the amount of waste sent to landfill has dropped by 30% since we started.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8225574ed02e1d29ac90725fa2ab37fca8d32555f6bb715a0a2a508fd970a098",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1372,
        "sourceEnd": 1399,
        "text": "And do students support it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "953efa2cb7a9e989321fc7dc20420efd457e65a3b79e782807c9921e98078619",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 1406,
        "sourceEnd": 1563,
        "text": "A survey showed that 80% of students support the program. That was our campus survey last week; it doesn't tell us what students at other universities think.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6a4e09df924068c374da85e9cb5c3ef2348ba91022040bc5b6e0fb5a1094455d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1569,
        "sourceEnd": 1587,
        "text": "What happens next?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c72895ba705e0802ce458857f0d4239190e7e19756e11e32ff3d045f5f5a9a8c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lisa",
        "speaker": "Lisa",
        "sourceStart": 1594,
        "sourceEnd": 1797,
        "text": "The university is planning to expand it to the local community next year. We hope it will inspire other groups. But the waste problem is not completely solved. We still find the wrong items in some bins.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "1e47af03897849e6b14135ecbd6871bfe2f2a9e0f5f4016e03db8734e5d61be1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1803,
        "sourceEnd": 1861,
        "text": "Then I'll see you on Tuesday and help with the next stage.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9a41c35bf9f6ebaf0d82e107cd737ceeb894c1102d6d4942281248e4ebec5c64",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
